.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Transient: the check scripts install playwright-core and tailwindcss with
# --no-save; see checks.yml.
#
# No trailing slash, deliberately. `node_modules/` matches the directory and
# not a symlink standing where it would be, and staging's #111 committed
# exactly that -- a link to the path on one Mac -- with git raising no
# objection, because as far as it was concerned the path was never ignored.
# The Pages artifact is a tar of the whole root, so that one entry failed the
# deploy while every check passed. Unslashed, the same `git add` needs a -f,
# and scripts/deployable.mjs refuses the tree either way.
node_modules

# Local agent and editor config: dev-server entries, worktrees, whatever lands
# beside them. Machine-specific, and nothing in it is needed to build, serve or
# read the site. Sessions run from this repository since 2026-09-08.
.claude/

# What draw.mjs keeps in the drawings' inbox: the queue, the reference as a
# PNG the chat will take, and what the generator returned before
# illustrate.mjs cut it into the set. The WebP that reaches img/writing/ is
# the artifact; these are its source, at 1.5 MB a picture.
img/inbox/QUEUE.json
img/inbox/style-reference.png
img/inbox/*.png
# hax-framework.png predates the inbox rule and is tracked. A tracked path the
# ignore file matches is exactly what deployable.mjs refuses, so it is excepted
# by name rather than left to be re-matched by the widened glob above.
!img/inbox/hax-framework.png
# The writing set's style reference is not one of the site's own pictures, so
# it is tracked here, excepted by name for the same reason.
!img/inbox/reference-binoculars.png
